    "Each mapping adds a -L (local forward), -R (remote forward), or -D (SOCKS proxy) flag to the SSH command." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个映射会向 SSH 命令添加一个 -L（本地转发）、-R（远程转发）或 -D（SOCKS 代理）参数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extra SSH options" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "额外 SSH 选项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For hosts recreated on the same address. Disables protection against a changed/spoofed host — use only on trusted networks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适用于在同一地址上重建的主机。这会关闭针对主机变更或伪造的保护，请仅在可信网络中使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For servers needing an interactive login (password, TOTP, Duo) the app can't answer: log in once in a terminal with  ssh -M -S <this path> -fN <host>  and answer the prompts there. While that master lives, this tunnel connects and auto-reconnects through it with no prompts; when it dies, reconnect it in the terminal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对于需要交互式登录（密码、TOTP、Duo）而本应用无法应答的服务器：先在终端中用  ssh -M -S <此路径> -fN <主机>  登录一次，并在那里完成验证。只要该主连接存活，此隧道就会通过它连接并自动重连，无需任何提示；主连接断开后，请在终端中重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常规"
          }
        }
      }
    },
