    "Refresh aliases" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刷新别名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "远程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote Forward" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "远程转发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replaces /usr/bin/ssh. First word is the executable, the rest lead the arguments. Only -N, the port forwards, Extra SSH options, and the host are passed — identity, port, and the app's OpenSSH -o options are skipped, since a non-OpenSSH client may reject them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "替代 /usr/bin/ssh。第一个词是可执行文件，其余部分作为参数的开头。只传递 -N、端口转发、额外 SSH 选项和主机；身份文件、端口以及本应用的 OpenSSH -o 选项会被跳过，因为非 OpenSSH 客户端可能不接受它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reuse existing SSH connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复用现有 SSH 连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reverse of a local forward: the server listens on the Remote address and sends connections back to the Local port on this Mac. Set the Remote host to 0.0.0.0 (and enable GatewayPorts on the server) to accept connections from beyond the server itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与本地转发方向相反：服务器在远程地址上监听，并将连接转回本 Mac 的本地端口。将远程主机设为 0.0.0.0（并在服务器上启用 GatewayPorts），即可接受来自服务器以外的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run command on connect" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接时运行命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on this Mac through your shell each time the tunnel connects, including auto-reconnects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次隧道连接（包括自动重连）时，通过你的 shell 在本 Mac 上运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs this instead of /usr/bin/ssh — any client that accepts OpenSSH-style -N/-L/-R/-D flags works (Teleport's tsh ssh, cloud CLI ssh wrappers, …). Passes only -N, the forwards, Extra SSH options, and the host — add anything else your command supports to Extra SSH options. Auth prompts can't be answered here, so log in (e.g. tsh login) in a terminal first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用它代替 /usr/bin/ssh 运行，任何接受 OpenSSH 风格 -N/-L/-R/-D 参数的客户端都可以（Teleport 的 tsh ssh、云平台 CLI 的 ssh 封装等）。只传递 -N、转发规则、额外 SSH 选项和主机；命令支持的其他参数请添加到额外 SSH 选项中。这里无法应答认证提示，请先在终端中登录（例如 tsh login）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sec" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seconds between keepalive probes that detect a dead connection. Blank uses the default (%lld)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于检测失效连接的保活探测间隔（秒）。留空则使用默认值（%lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seconds ssh waits to establish the connection before giving up. Blank = wait indefinitely." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ssh 放弃前等待建立连接的秒数。留空表示无限等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select a tunnel or divider from the sidebar, or create a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从侧边栏中选择一个隧道或分隔线，或新建一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets -o ControlPath=<value>. The forward attaches to the master connection behind this socket instead of authenticating itself. The app never creates a master; without a live one, connecting fails with a visible reason." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 -o ControlPath=<值>。转发会附加到该套接字背后的主连接上，而不是自行认证。本应用从不创建主连接；如果没有存活的主连接，连接会失败并显示原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets StrictHostKeyChecking=no and UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 StrictHostKeyChecking=no 和 UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets TCPKeepAlive=no, so a short outage doesn't tear the connection down at the TCP layer; the Alive Interval probes above handle liveness instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 TCPKeepAlive=no，短暂中断不会在 TCP 层断开连接，改由上面的保活间隔探测来判断连接是否存活。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show a notification on connect / disconnect" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接/断开时显示通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown as a divider in the sidebar and as a section with a master toggle in the menu bar. Leave empty for an unnamed divider." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在侧边栏中显示为分隔线，在菜单栏中显示为带总开关的分组。留空则为无名称的分隔线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip host key check" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跳过主机密钥检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SOCKS Proxy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SOCKS 代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SOCKS5 proxy — point your app or system proxy at this address." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SOCKS5 代理，将你的应用或系统代理指向此地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH Alias" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSH 别名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH Connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSH 连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ssh flags the UI doesn't cover, space-separated, e.g. -o ConnectTimeout=5 -o Foo=bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "界面未涵盖的 ssh 参数，以空格分隔，例如 -o ConnectTimeout=5 -o Foo=bar。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH Tunnel Manager" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Status" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Survive brief network drops" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "容忍短暂断网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sys on routes all of this Mac's traffic through the proxy (%@ is your current network service); Sys off restores it. Run them in a terminal; needs an admin account. Sys off stays shown here while the tunnel is down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sys on 会让本 Mac 的全部流量经过此代理（%@ 是你当前的网络服务）；Sys off 用于恢复。请在终端中运行，需要管理员账户。隧道断开时，这里仍会显示 Sys off。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server couldn’t bind the remote-forward port — it may already be in use there (or needs root for a port below 1024)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器无法绑定远程转发端口，该端口可能已在服务器上被占用（或者 1024 以下的端口需要 root 权限）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server refused the port forward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器拒绝了端口转发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle all tunnels in this group" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换此分组中的所有隧道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untitled" : {
      "comment" : "Placeholder for a tunnel saved without a name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未命名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "user@server.com" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Uses ~/.ssh/config alias (no -i flag needed)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 ~/.ssh/config 中的别名（无需 -i 参数）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v%@" : {
